  "Who led the first expedition to sail around the world (1519–1522)?": ["Magellan died in the Philippines in 1521; only one ship, led by Elcano, completed the trip.", "Magellan est mort aux Philippines en 1521 ; un seul navire, mené par Elcano, a bouclé le voyage."],
