  "In which year did Clint Eastwood first play Inspector Harry Callahan in Dirty Harry?": ["His \"Do you feel lucky, punk?\" speech is one of cinema's most quoted.", "Sa tirade « Do you feel lucky, punk? » est l'une des plus citées du cinéma."],
