  "In which film was the famous \"Wilhelm scream\" sound effect first used?": ["It's named after Private Wilhelm, a character in a later film who screams it.", "Il porte le nom du soldat Wilhelm, un personnage d'un film suivant qui pousse ce cri."],
  "How old was Laurence Fishburne when he was cast in Apocalypse Now?": ["He lied and said he was older to get the part.", "Il a menti en se disant plus âgé pour obtenir le rôle."],
