  "In Family Guy, Peter claims Meg's full first name is what?": ["Meg has been voiced by Mila Kunis since the second season.", "Meg est doublée par Mila Kunis depuis la deuxième saison (en VO)."],
  "What are the main enemies in Battlestar Galactica called?": ["Humans built them, and in the 2004 series some look exactly like people.", "Les humains les ont créés, et dans la série de 2004 certains ressemblent exactement à des humains."],
  "Who was the original voice of Shaggy in Scooby-Doo?": ["Kasem was vegan, and insisted that Shaggy become a vegetarian too.", "Kasem était végane et a insisté pour que Sammy devienne végétarien."],
  "In Friends, what is the name of Ross's pet monkey?": ["Marcel is a capuchin, and Ross ends up giving him to a zoo.", "Marcel est un capucin, et Ross finit par le confier à un zoo."],
  "In The Walking Dead, what is Daryl's last name?": ["Daryl was created for the TV show and never appeared in the original comics.", "Daryl a été créé pour la série et n'apparaissait pas dans la BD originale."],
  "Actor Alan Reed was the original voice of which cartoon character?": ["The Flintstones (1960) was the first animated sitcom in prime time.", "Les Pierrafeu (1960) a été la première sitcom animée diffusée en prime time."],
  "What was the children's channel Nickelodeon originally called?": ["The name comes from early 1900s cinemas that cost a nickel to enter.", "Le nom vient des cinémas du début des années 1900 où l'entrée coûtait un « nickel » (5 cents)."],
  "Baron Silas Greenback is the arch-enemy of which cartoon hero?": ["Greenback is a toad, and Danger Mouse's sidekick is the timid hamster Penfold.", "Greenback est un crapaud, et l'acolyte de Danger Mouse est le timide hamster Penfold."],
