  "In The Simpsons episode \"Bart Sells His Soul\", how much does Bart sell it for?": ["He sells it to Milhouse, written on a scrap of paper.", "Il la vend à Milhouse, écrite sur un bout de papier."],
  "Which Batman villain did Cesar Romero play in the 1960s TV series?": ["He refused to shave his moustache, so they painted white make-up over it.", "Il a refusé de raser sa moustache, alors on l'a recouverte de maquillage blanc."],
  "In Stranger Things, which song does Will sing to himself while he's missing?": ["It's by The Clash; his brother Jonathan introduced him to it.", "C'est un titre des Clash ; son frère Jonathan le lui a fait découvrir."],
  "In The Office (US), who does Michael Scott end up with?": ["Holly was played by Amy Ryan.", "Holly était jouée par Amy Ryan."],
  "Which Allman Brothers Band instrumental is the theme of the BBC show Top Gear?": ["Guitarist Dickey Betts wrote it so it could be played with just two fingers.", "Le guitariste Dickey Betts l'a écrit pour qu'on puisse le jouer avec seulement deux doigts."],
  "In The Big Bang Theory, at which university do Sheldon, Leonard, Raj and Howard work?": ["A real physicist, David Saltzberg, checked the science and the whiteboards.", "Un vrai physicien, David Saltzberg, vérifiait la science et les tableaux blancs."],
