  "Metal Gear's Meryl Silverburgh first appeared in which other Hideo Kojima game?": ["Policenauts (1994) is a sci-fi detective adventure set on a space colony.", "Policenauts (1994) est une aventure policière de science-fiction sur une colonie spatiale."],
