  "\"Exile\" and \"Revelation\" are the third and fourth games of which puzzle series?": ["The first Myst (1993) was one of the best-selling PC games of the 1990s.", "Le premier Myst (1993) a été l'un des jeux PC les plus vendus des années 1990."],
