  "Pink Floyd's \"Shine On You Crazy Diamond\" is a tribute to which former member?": ["Barrett turned up unannounced during the recording, so changed the band barely recognised him.", "Barrett est passé sans prévenir pendant l'enregistrement, si changé que le groupe l'a à peine reconnu."],
